                <p>{{ activePhotography.shot }}</p>
                <p class="framing-note">{{ activePhotography.framing }}</p>
                <div class="model-references"><figure v-for="(reference, i) in activeReferences" :key="reference.id"><img :src="appPath(reference.url)" :alt="i === 0 ? '商品主参考' : '同商品补充参考'" /><figcaption>{{ i === 0 ? '商品主参考' : '同商品对照' }}</figcaption></figure></div>
                <small>第一张决定商品外观；补充实拍只用于核对同款花色与结构，不混合其他颜色。</small>
              </details>
              <p class="field-footnote">只调整这一张的文案、编排与裁切，其他模块继续保留。</p>
              <div class="edit-buttons">
                <button class="button primary full" @click="s.downloadOne(activeModule)"><Download :size="17" />下载这一张</button>
                <template v-if="needsAI(p, activeModule)"><button class="button full" @click="retry(activeModule)"><Sparkles :size="16" />用自定义 API 重做这一张</button><small>重做会按当前分镜发起 1 次图片生成，费用按服务商结算。</small></template>
                <button class="button full" @click="closeEdit">完成编辑</button>
              </div>
            </fieldset>
          </div>
        </div>
      </dialog>
      <dialog ref="sourceDialog" class="product-source-dialog" aria-label="素材预览" @cancel.prevent="previewSource = null" @click="($event.target === $event.currentTarget) && (previewSource = null)"><div v-if="previewSource" class="source-shell"><header class="dialog-heading"><div><span>原始商品实拍</span><h2>{{ previewSource.name }}</h2></div><button class="icon-button" aria-label="关闭素材预览" @click="previewSource = null"><X :size="21" /></button></header><img :src="appPath(previewSource.url)" :alt="previewSource.name" /><p>{{ previewSource.width }} × {{ previewSource.height }} px · {{ previewSource.role }}图</p></div></dialog>
    </Teleport>
  </section>
